# A small Cube World-style island loaded from a MagicaVoxel .vox file:
# terrain and three instanced trees placed by the file's scene graph, glass
# water, an emissive lantern and a metal bell (MATL materials).
#
# "style voxel" gives it MagicaVoxel's look: sun, physically based sky,
# ground, ACES, bloom, vignette, bounce caps and see-through water shadows
# (see the comment at the top of include/scene.h). The camera adds a
# shallow depth of field, which makes it read as a miniature.
#
# models/island.vox is generated by tools/make_island_vox.py.

image_width  800
aspect_ratio 16/9
samples_per_pixel 256
max_depth    16

style voxel
sun elevation 35 azimuth 200

camera lookfrom 60 40 60  lookat 4 8 4  vfov 40
camera aperture 1.0 focus 80 blades 6

vox models/island.vox edges 0.04 0.05 0.05 0.05
